# AI Tools (LLM proofreading + Markdown generation + solve ops)

Admin batch feature that calls an OpenAI-compatible LLM over selected questions to proofread typed assets, transcribe images into Markdown, auto-tag questions, or **solve** a QUE to generate/check ANS / SOL / Answer Text. Runs stream a live SSE log with a real server-side Stop.

